#. A window without a title is announced as an unnamed frame; name the dock so
#. * a screen reader says what surface the focus just landed on.
#: src/main.c:917
msgid "Lambdock dock"
msgstr ""

#: src/dock_window.c:1877
msgid ""
"A modern Wayland-native hackable desktop dock bar.\n"
"\n"
"Engineered with the performance of C and GTK4 Layer Shell for smooth auto-"
"hide and animations, featuring dynamic Wayland toplevel window tracking, "
"live CSS hot-reloading, and dynamic configuration powered by GNU Guile "
"Scheme."
msgstr ""
"Een moderne, hackable Wayland-native desktop-dock.\n"
"\n"
"Ontwikkeld met de prestaties van C en GTK4 Layer Shell voor soepel "
"automatisch verbergen en vloeiende animaties, voorzien van dynamische "
"Wayland toplevel venstertracking, live CSS hot-reloading en een dynamische "
"configuratie aangedreven door GNU Guile Scheme."

